- `"user_role"` → `"role"`
- `"sku_inventory"` → `"sku_inventories"`
- `"machine_details"` → `"mechanic_details"` (Also mapping the keyword "mechanic" here)
- `"withdrawal"` → `"withdrawal_request"`
- `"automatic_transaction_bank"` → `"automatic_transactions"`

### Server Restart
After making this code change, the FastAPI application caches the `BusinessKnowledgeGraph` via a singleton `_kg_instance`. I will restart the backend server so it reloads the updated mappings and newly generated schema metadata into memory.

